OL,3,GNEWSATrailers used to steal 70,000
OL,4,Apints of Guinness found
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrailers used to steal more than 800
OL,7,Fbarrels of Guinness have been found in
OL,8,FSkelmersdale, some 30 miles (km) from
OL,9,Fwhere they were stolen, police said.
OL,11,FAbout 70,000 pints worth of the stout,
OL,12,Festimated to be worth #115,000, was
OL,13,Ftaken from Whitehouse Industrial Estate
OL,14,Fon Aston Lane in Runcorn on 31 August,
OL,15,FCheshire Police said.
OL,17,FOne wagon-load was taken at about 19:45
OL,18,FBST and a second one was stolen at
OL,19,Fabout 21:30.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
