OL,3,GNEWSATrailers used to steal 70,000
OL,4,Apints of Guinness found
OL,5,
OL,6,FLancashire Police said the barrels -
OL,7,Fwhich hold about 88 pints and were
OL,8,Fdestined for pubs - have not been found
OL,9,Fyet nor have there been any arrests and
OL,10,Fdetectives were appealing for
OL,11,Finformation.
